IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Certo, va bene,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} ma questo è il modo
